<title>FRANCE: EU adds 200,000 T to German intvn export rye. [corrected 17:00 gmt]</title>
<headline>EU adds 200,000 T to German intvn export rye. [corrected 17:00 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects grain variety to rye from barley in headline and text.)</p>
<p>The European Union on Thursday raised its export allocation for German intervention rye by 200,000 tonnes, a European Commission official said. (Corrects attribution from &quot;member country officials&quot;.)</p>
</text>
